WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:07.440
photography is often called the universal hobby&nbsp;
it is a means of creative expression within the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:13.360
reach of people in all walks of life and it&nbsp;
speaks a language that everyone can understand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:21.520
the camera lens is a mechanical eye seeing&nbsp;
everything and recording everything it captures&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:28.080
actions that will never again be repeated&nbsp;
used with a microscope it records the strange&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.640
activities of tiny organisms with the x-ray it&nbsp;
reveals the structure or function of hidden things

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:43.200
if objects move too fast to be seen clearly&nbsp;
by the unaided eye the camera slows them down&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:49.680
so that the action may be studied in contrast&nbsp;
hours of action may be compressed into seconds

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:58.000
photography in one form or another exerts&nbsp;
a great influence on our daily lives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.520
photographs bring news reports to life&nbsp;
they strengthen the appeal of advertising&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:11.680
they provide entertainment for millions and are&nbsp;
an aid to education photography as a hobby can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:17.680
lead to photography as a career and often&nbsp;
does but professional work calls for a lot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:23.600
more than just snapping pictures here and there&nbsp;
for instance consider the portrait photographer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:29.440
to make a real success in this highly&nbsp;
competitive field the cameraman must be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:34.880
a practical psychologist who understands the&nbsp;
personality of each individual he photographs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:42.560
people want to look their best in fact better&nbsp;
than they look so the photographer must know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:47.600
all the tricks of lighting and the posing to&nbsp;
achieve a flattering likeness of the subject&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:54.080
to get good negatives he must&nbsp;
master the chemistry of photography&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:58.240
he should also know how to retouch&nbsp;
negatives to remove wrinkles and blemishes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:05.680
if he can't do this work himself part of his&nbsp;
income will go for pay to a hired retoucher&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:10.800
making the prints is the most&nbsp;
important step in portrait work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:16.320
and good printing can only be learned&nbsp;
through long practice and study

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:24.800
all the previous work and the success of&nbsp;
the whole job depends on the final print&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:30.480
if it pleases the subject and her&nbsp;
friends it may lead to more business&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:38.640
and a portrait man must keep busy if he's to&nbsp;
make money the illustrative photographer's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:42.960
work calls for a well-equipped studio&nbsp;
and a great amount of skill and ingenuity&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:49.520
each picture must be tailor-made to the&nbsp;
specifications outlined by the art director&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:55.920
of the advertising agency requesting it an&nbsp;
illustrative photographer must be imaginative&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.560 --> 00:03:01.360
for he never knows what sort of advertising&nbsp;
picture he will be asked to make on short notice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:06.720
jobs requiring reproduction of outdoor&nbsp;
settings or large interior scenes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:12.640
can only be handled by those who have big&nbsp;
studios but there are many advertising&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:19.200
photographs which can be made on tabletops or&nbsp;
in close quarters making this type of picture&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:23.280
gives the smaller operator a chance in&nbsp;
the field of illustrative photography

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:29.120
the commercial photographer is&nbsp;
often called a jack of all trades&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.000
he must be prepared to go anywhere to&nbsp;
take pictures in addition to those he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:39.920
makes in his studio today he may be shooting the&nbsp;
exterior of a building for a real estate operator&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:46.320
tomorrow he may be in a factory making a series&nbsp;
of pictures showing a manufacturing process&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:53.120
yes the commercial man's pictures are likely to&nbsp;
include anything and everything machinery food&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.080 --> 00:04:01.920
poultry buildings and so on because of this great&nbsp;
variety of work the commercial photographer's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:08.160
field tends to overlap those of the portrait man&nbsp;
and the illustrative photographer some of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:14.640
shots may even be used by the press but basically&nbsp;
press or news photography is a field in itself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:22.400
contrary to popular opinion a press photographer's&nbsp;
life is not just one big thrill after another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:29.920
he does shoot exciting scenes from time to&nbsp;
time but such events are the exception most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:35.280
of his work is routine in nature consisting&nbsp;
mainly of pictures of people and places&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:41.840
connected with the news nevertheless the news&nbsp;
photographer must work expertly at high speed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:49.440
and know what constitutes a news picture&nbsp;
similar to press photography is newsreel work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:56.160
but it is difficult to enter as a cameraman&nbsp;
because the field is overcrowded this also is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.160 --> 00:05:01.600
true of theatrical motion picture production&nbsp;
in addition it takes years of training and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:07.680
experience to master the complicated cameras the&nbsp;
lighting problems and the use of special effects&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:14.560
and in spite of these rigid requirements&nbsp;
hollywood has more cameramen than opportunities&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:18.240
but there are other jobs in&nbsp;
motion picture production&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:24.640
not only for the theater but also in educational&nbsp;
industrial and other non-theatrical films&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:28.960
there are many small producers&nbsp;
specializing in this type of picture

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:36.400
the whole field of photography offers numerous&nbsp;
positions that do not call for actual camera&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:41.200
work but provide valuable training to&nbsp;
those who want to become photographers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:49.200
laboratory or darkroom assistants and technicians&nbsp;
have an opportunity to learn how to mix chemicals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:57.440
to develop films to retouch negatives and to&nbsp;
make prints studio assistants and cameramen's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:02.800
helpers have a chance to learn the practical&nbsp;
side of professional work they become familiar&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:08.560
with equipment which the average amateur doesn't&nbsp;
use they learn how lights are placed to achieve&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:13.360
the balance between highlight and shadow&nbsp;
which is necessary for all good pictures

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:19.840
working as a salesman in a photo supply&nbsp;
store is another way to gain experience&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:25.920
the best salesman are those who know photography&nbsp;
and are able to answer the customer's many&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:32.880
requests for advice establishing your own camera&nbsp;
shop or photo finishing service is a possibility&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:38.720
for one who learns the business and has&nbsp;
the necessary capital another possibility&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:45.040
is working for one of the big manufacturers&nbsp;
of photographic equipment and supplies these&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:51.440
factories employ thousands of persons from machine&nbsp;
operators to highly trained engineers and chemists

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:58.400
persons who are interested in photography can&nbsp;
start it as a hobby to be followed during spare&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:04.880
time while holding a job or attending school some&nbsp;
schools have photography departments and camera&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:11.040
clubs many students acquire practical experience&nbsp;
by making pictures for the school paper and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:17.120
yearbook you can learn a great deal by reading the&nbsp;
many excellent books and magazines on the subject&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:22.320
and there are numerous exhibitions where&nbsp;
you can learn by studying the work of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:28.240
well-known photographers there are private&nbsp;
schools of photography in the large cities&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:33.520
offering complete courses of training to prepare&nbsp;
you for any type of professional still work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:38.720
you may find that you prefer to&nbsp;
photograph a certain type of subject&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:46.400
many photographers owe their success to&nbsp;
specialization it might be still life babies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.440 --> 00:08:01.840
animals aerial views airplanes sports&nbsp;
scenics railroads medicine or fashions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:09.120
there is almost no end to special subjects&nbsp;
and some amateurs have made their hobby pay by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:14.720
selling prints to photo syndicates or to magazines&nbsp;
and newspapers interested in a particular type

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:22.160
picture editors on the staffs of publications&nbsp;
are always on the lookout for good pictures&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:29.920
and here too is another job for the person who&nbsp;
knows photography the position of picture editor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:36.080
this work is open to both men and women whose&nbsp;
background and training fit the photographic and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:42.640
journalistic requirements of certain publications&nbsp;
the photo engraving departments of publications&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:49.680
and printing concerns offer still another type of&nbsp;
work thus the field of photography is broad enough&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:56.000
to provide opportunities to thousands of persons&nbsp;
with various aptitudes interests and educational&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.000 --> 00:09:02.960
backgrounds new applications for photography are&nbsp;
constantly being discovered and new materials and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:09.040
tools are being produced just what place you&nbsp;
might take in this growing industry depends on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:15.840
your abilities and inclinations but if you have a&nbsp;
sincere interest in photographic work it would be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:24.160
worthwhile to investigate the field carefully some&nbsp;
phase of photography may become your life work

